### FoodLoop REST API Test Suite

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### 2. Login as Donor (Chef Sharma)
# @name donorLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "donor@foodloop.org",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store token
@donorToken = {{donorLogin.response.body.token}}

### 3. Login as Recipient NGO (Sister Teresa - Hope Shelter)
# @name ngoLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ngo@foodloop.org",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store token
@ngoToken = {{ngoLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. Login as Volunteer Courier (Alex Courier)
# @name volunteerLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "volunteer@foodloop.org",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store token
@volToken = {{volunteerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 5. Login as Administrator
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@foodloop.org",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store token
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 6. Create Surplus Food Donation (Donor)
# @name createDonation
POST http://localhost:5000/api/donations
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foodTitle": "50 Hot Vegetarian Meals",
  "category": "prepared_meals",
  "quantity": 50,
  "unit": "portions",
  "estimatedServings": 50,
  "dietaryClassification": ["vegetarian"],
  "preparationTime": "2026-10-19T16:00:00.000Z",
  "collectionWindow": {
    "startTime": "2026-10-19T16:30:00.000Z",
    "deadline": "2026-10-19T21:30:00.000Z"
  },
  "storageAndHandling": {
    "storageType": "hot_holding",
    "handlingInstructions": "Keep insulated"
  },
  "safetyDeclaration": {
    "isSafeAndEdible": true,
    "storedAtSafeTemperature": true,
    "preparedWithCleanUtensils": true
  },
  "pickupAddress": {
    "formattedAddress": "Connaught Place, New Delhi"
  },
  "coordinates": [77.2197, 28.6328]
}

@newDonationId = {{createDonation.response.body.donation._id}}

### 7. Run Feasibility-First Matching Engine
GET http://localhost:5000/api/matching/{{newDonationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}

### 8. Claim Donation (Recipient NGO)
# @name claimDonation
POST http://localhost:5000/api/donations/{{newDonationId}}/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{ngoToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestedQuantity": 50,
  "recipientNotes": "Dinner service for shelter"
}

@requestId = {{claimDonation.response.body.donationRequest._id}}

### 9. Accept Request (Donor)
# @name acceptRequest
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/requests/{{requestId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{donorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "donorNotes": "Approved for collection"
}

@pickupId = {{acceptRequest.response.body.pickup._id}}
@pickupOtp = {{acceptRequest.response.body.pickup.pickupCode}}

### 10. View Recipient Delivery OTP Code
GET http://localhost:5000/api/pickups/{{pickupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ngoToken}}

### 11. Courier Accepts Task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/pickups/{{pickupId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{volToken}}

### 12. Courier Updates Status to EN_ROUTE
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/pickups/{{pickupId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{volToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "EN_ROUTE"
}

### 13. Courier Updates Status to ARRIVED_AT_DONOR
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/pickups/{{pickupId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{volToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ARRIVED_AT_DONOR"
}

### 14. Courier Verifies Donor Pickup OTP
POST http://localhost:5000/api/pickups/{{pickupId}}/verify-handover
Authorization: Bearer {{volToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handoverType": "pickup",
  "code": "{{pickupOtp}}"
}

### 15. View System Impact Analytics
GET http://localhost:5000/api/analytics/overview

### 16. Admin Reviews Audit Trail
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/audit-logs?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
